PR #1 merged the first draft. This adds what was decided after it:
- ADR-0015: the repo is public (Free plan: no branch protection or
  CODEOWNERS on private), its name is rokey_cobot2_VOSS_2, keys and tokens
  stay out (none in history); the lab's private 192.168.1.x addresses were
  already public in the old repo and stay, no new ones (robot address via
  VOSS_ROBOT_HOST); neutral wording on the account suspension
- README / SETUP / conventions: repository URL with _2

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README.md                       | 2 +-
 SETUP.md                        | 2 +-
 docs/adr/0015-repo-migration.md | 5 +++--
 docs/conventions.md             | 2 +-
 4 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

